WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.450
An island.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.820
A man born there welcomes
a stranger in a robe,

3
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.370
newly arrived from the sea.

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.710
Years later, the stranger
rules the island.

5
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.950
The man who welcomed him
is shut up in a rock.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.000
His name is Caliban, and he is
furious: "This island's mine,

7
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:22.730
by Sycorax my mother,
which thou tak'st from me."

8
00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:24.730
But whose story are we hearing?

9
00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.080
And is Caliban right?

10
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.950
In this mission, you'll
weigh Caliban's claim,

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.250
and the serious charge
Prospero makes against him.

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.300
You'll discover a real shipwreck of 1609,

13
00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.640
on the way to a new English colony.

14
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:43.180
And you'll see how readers since about
1950 have changed the way this play is

15
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.220
read.

16
00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.480
Your mission: decide
whether Caliban is right.
